{"unit_id":"tag:06H9:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是余纤维于群胚的范畴（categories cofibered in groupoids）的态射（morphism），定义在<MATH_0002>上。则有诱导的态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>，其对象是<MATH_0004>上的余纤维于群胚的范畴（categories cofibered in groupoids）。它将对象（object）<MATH_0005>（属于<MATH_0006>）送到<MATH_0007>，并将态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>（在对象（objects）<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>之间，它们属于<MATH_0011>）送到<MATH_0012>。最后，若<MATH_0013>是<MATH_0014>-态射（morphism），位于<MATH_0015>-态射（morphisms）<MATH_0016>之间，其对象是群胚（groupoids）中的余纤维（cofibred）范畴（categories），则得到<MATH_0017>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0018>。即，对上述<MATH_0019>，置<MATH_0020>。因此，完备化（completion）定义了<MATH_0021>-范畴（categories）之间的函子（functor）<MATH_0022>，从<MATH_0023>-范畴（category）（其对象为<MATH_0024>上群胚（groupoids）中的余纤维（cofibred）范畴（categories））到<MATH_0025>-范畴（category）（其对象为<MATH_0026>上群胚（groupoids）中的余纤维（cofibred）范畴（categories））。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"categories cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"余纤维于群胚的范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"categories cofibered in groupoids","target_term":"余纤维于群胚的范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"cofibred","target_term":"余纤维"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"completion","target_term":"完备化"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"cofibred","target_term":"余纤维"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"cofibred","target_term":"余纤维"},{"source